== Is the project on schedule?
No. The project is 8 weeks behind, according to the (admittedly ambitious) proposed work plan. I'm supposed to have completed by now, but haven't, the following:
- Complete Introduction chapter -- only draft produced
- Complete Preparation chapter -- only rough notes completed
- Whole dissertation outline -- only introduction and implementation drafted or outlined
- Project core and all extensions -- core mostly completed, no extensions started

== What unexpected difficulties have arisen?
I have been ill 6-7 times since the start of Michaelmas which has slowed progress across all areas.

Additionally, completing the "core" of my project to a high quality was a larger design and implementation feat than expected. However, I am very happy with the result. It will make testing easier and more thorough, and the project has become better than I initially imagined.

== Remedial action
There have been no big blockers or substantial issues, just that progress has been slower than expected. I will focus more on the written dissertation, and perhaps do fewer extensions than planned given the increased effort put into the core.

In the short term I will focus on writing everything that doesn't depend on a completed codebase; it is the writing not the code which gets you the marks, after all. I will then prioritise finishing the codebase and tests for an MVP, and the Evaluation chapter. If there is time, I may do some extensions before the Conclusion chapter.

